<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Luis Abinader</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">b. 1967</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Luis Abinader is a Dominican economist and businessman who leads the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/modern-revolutionary-party">Modern Revolutionary Party</a>. He won the presidency of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dominican-republic">Dominican Republic</a> in 2020, ending sixteen years of government by the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/dominican-liberation-party">Dominican Liberation Party</a>, and was re-elected in 2024. His governments have emphasised anti-corruption measures, tourism and a tough line on migration from neighbouring <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/haiti">Haiti</a>.</p></div>
